<title>POLAND: Warsaw bourse clears ZEW, Unibud for trade.</title>
<headline>Warsaw bourse clears ZEW, Unibud for trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of the Warsaw Stock Exchange (WSE) cleared for trade on the main market shares of electrode maker Zaklady Elektrod Weglowych SA (ZEW) and construction company Unibud SA, it said in a Wednesday statement.</p>
<p>The bourse also cleared for trade on the parallel market shares of trader BEST SA, construction materials maker Bauma SA and chemical firm Viscoplast SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
